{"id":"5447","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5447_main_nimbostratus-virga-and-cumulus-fractus-of-wet-weather_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这个厚云层呈灰色，无定形，是典型的从蔽光高层云发展成的雨层云。降水大概是以雪的形式开始，但在其到达地面之前在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">蒸发</span>。这是幡状附加特征。有些幡状雨幡呈<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">袋状</span>，几乎使人想起悬球状附加特征。在地平线，有一些风吹过的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">潮湿天气碎积云</span>。在照片拍摄后的几分钟，开始了降雨。明显的暖锋正在向东抵近。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Martin Gudd","location":"德国，巴特克罗伊茨纳赫","latitude":"纬度: 49° 50' 39'' N","longitude":"经度: 7° 50' 32'' E","date":"31 January 2016 1040 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 7, CM= 2, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.6.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.6.2"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5447_syn_nimbostratus-virga-and-cumulus-fractus-of-wet-weather_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>天气图为照片拍摄后不久的天气形势。欧洲中部处于强西风气流影响下。明显的暖锋正在向东抵近，带来了厚云、降雨以及稳步上升的气温。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Verein Berliner Wetterkarte e.V.","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5447_upper_nimbostratus-virga-and-cumulus-fractus-of-wet-weather_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>从西西南方向30公里进行的探测 – 从地面到对流层顶的深层水汽</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5447_sat_nimbostratus-virga-and-cumulus-fractus-of-wet-weather_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>卫星图片为照片拍摄后不久的天气形势。气旋活动正控制着欧洲大部分地区。厚锋面云带正从不列颠群岛向东南方向延伸至阿尔卑斯山，继而延伸至欧洲东南部。这是一股暖锋，它将欧洲北部上空的极地气团与欧洲西南部的副热带气团分隔开。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Verein Berliner Wetterkarte e.V.","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}